  "text": "Our Approach - Heal Cancer Care for Pets\nSkip to content\n1642 W. Armory Way, Ste. 102 Seattle, WA\n206.888.4325\nRx\nNew Patients\nRx\nNew Patients\nAbout\nOur Approach\nMeet the Veterinary Team\nCareers\nCancer Care\nPet Parents\nVeterinary Colleagues\nPatient Stories\nContact\nAbout\nOur Approach\nMeet the Veterinary Team\nCareers\nCancer Care\nPet Parents\nVeterinary Colleagues\nPatient Stories\nContact\nOur Approach\nOur Approach\nto Cancer Care for Pets\nWhen you entrust\nHEAL\nto provide cancer care for your pet, you gain access to today’s most advanced and proven treatments from a top-notch team of\nveterinary oncology\nexperts.\nBut superb clinical care is just the start.\nIt’s\nhow\nwe provide this care that truly sets HEAL apart.\nPersonalized\nGuidance and Support\nHere’s what you and your pet can always count on at HEAL:\nYou have a trusted guide throughout your pet’s cancer journey —\nWe share our knowledge about your pet’s diagnosis, treatment options, prognosis and progress, so you can make informed, thoughtful decisions about your pet’s care and know what to expect all along the way.\nYour pet’s treatment plan is personalized —\nThere’s no cookie-cutter medicine here. We strive to balance our clinical expertise with your emotional needs and financial considerations, all the while keeping your pet’s quality of life front and center.\nYour visits to our office are free from added stressors —\nOur team incorporates low-stress handling, specialized staff training, pet-friendly interior design, calming aromatherapy in waiting areas, and other techniques to help your pet—and you—feel safe, supported, and comfortable.\nYou won’t wait long for an appointment —\nWe understand you want to see a specialist as soon as possible, yet the average wait for a veterinary oncology appointment in greater Seattle is 5 to 6 weeks. Not at HEAL. We opened our doors to help fill this demand and we have the capacity to get your pet in to see the veterinary oncologist within days.\nYou can count on us for open, honest communication —\nWe want you to always know where things stand. We listen to you, we answer your questions, we explain everything, so you feel clear and confident about your pet’s care. And we keep your referring veterinarian in the loop, too.\nIt all comes down to this:\nWe not only want to give your pet the best possible medical outcome, but we also strive to make this entire process as gentle and stress-free as possible—for both your pet and for you.\nSchedule a Consultation with HEAL\nTo schedule a consultation, simply contact us. Teleconsultations are also available by completing our\nNew Patient Form\n. We will be in touch shortly.\nWe’re here for you and your pet.\nContact Us\nContact Information\n1642 W. Armory Way, Ste. 102 Seattle, WA 98119\nFree on-site parking available\n206.888.HEAL (4325)\ninfo@healpetcancer.com\nSocial Media\nFacebook\nInstagram\nCopyright © 2026 HEAL Cancer Care for Pets. All Rights Reserved.  |\nPrivacy Policy\n|\nTerms & Conditions\nScroll Up\nAbout\nOur Approach\nMeet the Veterinary Team\nCareers\nCancer Care\nPet Parents\nVeterinary Colleagues\nPatient Stories\nContact\nRx\nNew Patients\n642 W. Armory Way, Ste. 102 Seattle, WA 98119\n206.888.HEAL (4325)\ninfo@healpetcancer.com\nFacebook\nInstagram\nSchedule Here",
